{"title":"Seniors Pancyprian Competition","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Cyprus Juniors Pancyprian competition</b> is the second competition in the series of competitions used to challenge bright students on the path toward choosing the team that represents Cyprus at the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"International Mathematical Olympiad\">IMO</a>. It is held in December and is called \"Zenon\". All participants in this contest have been first qualified in  <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Provincial_competition\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition\">Cyprus Seniors Provincial competition</a>. Until 2003 2nd and 3rd grades had common papers. As of 2004 every grade has different problems. Afterwards 10 students from every grade are selected.\n</p><p><b>Total:</b> 3 grades * 10 students = 30 students.\n</p><p>Those students are qualified to move on the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_Seniors_Team_Selection_Tests\" title=\"Cyprus Seniors Team Selection Tests\">Cyprus Seniors Team Selection Tests</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Seniors Pancyprian Problems and Solutions\">Seniors Pancyprian Problems and Solutions</a> -- A community effort to provide solutions to all Seniors Pancyprian competitions problems from which students can learn.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Seniors_Pancyprian_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Cyprus mathematics competitions\">Cyprus mathematics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110213\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4344:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018110213 and revision id 25821. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}